            "review_title": "Review at Heritage Coffee Restaurant",
            "review_text": "chiangmaicharlies\nChiang Mai, Thailand5472 contributions\n0\nIdeal place for Vietnamese food, between tourist visits\nOct 2019\nWell, what a wide range of reviews this place gets!\n\nWe had a great lunch there. Plenty to choose from the menu, and it offered more authentic Vietnamese dishes than many other restaurants.\n\nIt's ideally located if you're visiting the war museum or the old citadel, which we were. Not so many other eateries nearby.\n\nWe found the staff very friendly and very helpful. They had limited English, but certainly tried to understand. Who can fault that? Some, by looking at the reviews!\n\nPlenty of comfortable outside seating in a big courtyard. Shaded in many places. \n\nHighly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 20, 2019",
