            "review_text": "Beesy1950\nAdelaide, Australia100 contributions\n0\nGreat place to chill out and relax\nApr 2017\nWe went to the military museum just as it was closing so walked round the corner and found this cafe with a lovely courtyard.\n\nSmall Hanoi beers were 25K VND each and sometimes after a few weeks eating just asian food you crave something different so we ordered chips they were 65K VND,\n\nWe took in the lovely relaxing atmosphere drinking the ice cold beer on a hot day and enjoyed a couple of hours of relaxation.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 10, 2018",
