            "review_title": "Review at Heritage Coffee Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lexincats\nCambridge, United Kingdom50 contributions\n0\nA nice place for a casual lunch\nJan 2017 • Family\nHad my lunch here whilst waiting for the Citadel next door to open as it was lunch hour. They offer a both Vietnamese and European cuisines, as well as a variety of drinks. The food was just alright: the fruit salad and club sandwich were very heavy with mayo, although the cookies and cream drink was very refreshing. The staff helped us arrange the tables so that the parasols would shade us from the sun. There is indoor seating, but we chose to sit outdoors as it may be stuffy inside, although be warned there are a few flies around.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 6, 2017",
